<title>USA: U.S. livestock slaughter, meat production - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. livestock slaughter, meat production - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported total commercial livestock slaughterings as follows: (1,000 head):</p>
<p>			CATTLE    CALVES    HOGS</p>
<p>	  Sep 96    2,761.2   149.7   7,700.0</p>
<p>	  Aug 96-R  3,214.1   157.8   7,674.8</p>
<p>	  Sep 95    3,098.0   122.3   7,920.4</p>
<p>	    --</p>
<p>	 1996	27,676.8 1,303.5  68,562.9</p>
<p>	 1995	26,749.5 1,044.0  71,128.5</p>
<p>Commercial meat production (million lbs):</p>
<p>		BEEF    VEAL    PORK</p>
<p>   Sep 96  1,935     31    1,408</p>
<p>   Aug 96  2,262-R   32    1,394</p>
<p>   Sep 95  2,220     26    1,438</p>
<p>---</p>
<p> 1996 --  19,333    272   12,633</p>
<p> 1995 --  18,839    228   13,121</p>
<p>USDA detailed livestock slaughtered under federal inspection for 48 states as follows:</p>
<p>		    Sep 96    Aug 96  Sep 95</p>
<p>CATTLE (1,000 head) --</p>
<p>	   Steers  1,269   1,558   1,545</p>
<p>	  Heifers    808     930     927</p>
<p>     Dairy Cows    240     254     234</p>
<p>     Other Cows    312     337-R   268</p>
<p>   Bulls, Stags     64	69	60</p>
<p>   Total	   2,693   3,148-R 3,035</p>
<p>R--Revised  </p>
<p>HOGS (1,000 head) --</p>
<p>		     Sep 96   Aug 96   Sep 95</p>
<p> Barrows, Gilts   7,227    7,169   7,383</p>
<p>	     Sows     260	284     301</p>
<p>   Stags, Boars	53	 57	67</p>
<p>	    Total   7,540    7,509   7,752</p>
<p>Note - Totals may not add due to rounding.  </p>
<p>Cumulative totals --</p>
<p>		    1996	   1995</p>
<p>CATTLE (1,000 head):</p>
<p>	 Steers  13,527	13,724</p>
<p>	Heifers   7,881	 7,614</p>
<p>   Dairy Cows   2,215	 2,100</p>
<p>   Other Cows   2,886	 2,267</p>
<p> Bulls, Stags     538	   507</p>
<p>	  Total  27,046	26,212</p>
<p>Cumulative totals --</p>
<p>			 1996	  1995</p>
<p>HOGS (1,000 head) --</p>
<p> Barrows, Gilts  64,015	66,085</p>
<p>	     Sows   2,650	 2,785</p>
<p>   Stags, Boars     519	   670</p>
<p>	    Total  67,185	69,540</p>
